OL,3,GNEWSACall for by-election as councillor
OL,4,Aquits Reform
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK councillor on Bradford
OL,7,FCouncil has left the party to stand as
OL,8,Fan independent.
OL,10,FBolton and Undercliffe councillor Jon
OL,11,FBarras was elected to the ward in May
OL,12,F2026 alongside Labour candidates Suhail
OL,13,FChoudry and Md Zafar Niaz.
OL,15,FBarras said while he supported the
OL,16,Fparty nationally, he was stepping down
OL,17,Fbecause of calls to remove Bradford's
OL,18,FCity of Sanctuary status and give more
OL,19,Feducation funding to white working
OL,20,Fclass boys.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
