OL,3,GNEWSACall for by-election as councillor
OL,4,Aquits Reform
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform group leader and Bradford
OL,7,FCouncil boss Stephen Place called for
OL,8,Fthe councillor to resign his seat and
OL,9,Ffor a by-election to be held in the
OL,10,Fward, but Barras said he would not step
OL,11,Fdown.
